    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berghotel Heist is a co-op horror game rooted in Austrian folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.poster.avif?t=1753979280\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.webm?t=1753979280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.mp4?t=1753979280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows two thieves that break into a ski hotel to steal valuable items and slip away unnoticed. But what starts as a routine heist turns into a desperate struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hotel holds a dark secret, it is haunted by restless spirits and a troubled past that refuses to stay buried. Soon it becomes clear that the thieves are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.poster.avif?t=1753979280\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.webm?t=1753979280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.mp4?t=1753979280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, they must work together to evade the sinister forces hunting them,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and find a way out\u2014before the hotel claims them forever.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berghotel Heist is a co-op horror game rooted in Austrian folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.poster.avif?t=1753979280\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.webm?t=1753979280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.mp4?t=1753979280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows two thieves that break into a ski hotel to steal valuable items and slip away unnoticed. But what starts as a routine heist turns into a desperate struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hotel holds a dark secret, it is haunted by restless spirits and a troubled past that refuses to stay buried. Soon it becomes clear that the thieves are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.poster.avif?t=1753979280\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.webm?t=1753979280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.mp4?t=1753979280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, they must work together to evade 